-price divided by 12.
+Prices are typed in euros (`12.99`, `1,299.00`) and kept in whole cents. Monthly costs are rounded to the nearest cent. The monthly cost of a yearly plan is its price divided by 12. The monthly cost of a weekly plan is its price multiplied by 52 and divided by 12.
 
